flowchart LR
  User[Employee browser] -->|HTTPS| ALB[Application Load Balancer]
  ALB --> WEB[2+ ECS web tasks]
  ALB --> API[2+ ECS API tasks]
  API --> RDS[(RDS PostgreSQL Multi-AZ)]
  API --> S3[(Versioned private S3)]
  API --> VALKEY[(ElastiCache Valkey Multi-AZ)]
  API --> IDP[Enterprise OIDC IdP]
  API --> BEDROCK[Approved Bedrock model]
  WORKER[2+ ECS worker tasks] --> RDS
  WORKER --> S3
  WORKER --> VALKEY
  API --> OTLP[Private OTLP collector]
  WORKER --> OTLP
  WEB --> CW[CloudWatch logs and alarms]
  API --> CW
  WORKER --> CW
  SECRETS[Secrets Manager references] --> API
  SECRETS --> WORKER

